cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AgriDesign: Design and Analysis of Agricultural Experiments"
abstract: >-
  R package for the design and analysis of agricultural experiments: analysis of
  variance of 16 classical designs with the right error strata, assumption checks,
  mean separation with eleven procedures and compact letters, recovery of
  inter-block information by REML, randomised field layouts, plant breeding and
  plant pathology analyses, publication figures and HTML reports. Base R only.
